<header class=3D"hero">
  <div class=3D"hero-inner">
    <div class=3D"eyebrow">Schema &amp; resolver mechanics</div>
    <h1>The GraphQL Field Guide</h1>
    <p class=3D"hero-sub">One endpoint, one schema, and a response whose sh=
ape the <em>caller</em> writes. How a query document becomes a tree of reso=
lver calls =E2=80=94 worked through with the actual <code>EventGraphQlContr=
oller</code> from the clickhouse-playground repo, then set side by side aga=
inst the same repo's REST and gRPC transports.</p>
  </div>
</header>

