  <!-- 02 SCHEMA -->
  <section>
    <div class=3D"section-head"><span class=3D"section-num">02</span><h2>Th=
e Schema Is the Contract</h2></div>
    <p class=3D"section-dek">Like gRPC's <code>.proto</code>, GraphQL is sc=
hema-first: <code>src/main/resources/graphql/schema.graphqls</code> is the =
whole contract, and Spring validates every incoming document against it bef=
ore a line of controller code runs. Unlike <code>.proto</code>, nothing is =
code-generated =E2=80=94 the schema and the Java are bound by <em>name</em>=
.</p>

    <div class=3D"grid2">
